#: ce3110932c0e4f068b40b6b7e90db96c
msgid "Archived:PX4IO Overview"
msgstr "已归档：PX4IO 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:9
#: 43ced78d324142dc9622886a4226a118
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:11
#: 70d22d141d574616a9663fae3c430e8c
msgid ""
"The PX4FMU (\"PX4\") is end of life and is not generally available for "
"purchase - ditto this companion board! This article is made available for "
"existing users."
msgstr "PX4FMU（「PX4」）已停产，通常无法购买——本配套板亦如此！本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:14
#: 6d039d34257745bea44d52941de85eac
msgid ""
"The PX4-IO board Contains its own on board microcontroller and stacks with "
"the PX4-FMU board."
msgstr "PX4-IO 板内置独立微控制器，可与 PX4-FMU 板叠加安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:16
#: d89761d2c71245f28da6096f968619dd
msgid "Built in Brownout proof direct battery input power supply."
msgstr "内置防掉电直接电池输入供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:17
#: ff8baa38db604d9ba7ff23c1c770f0c9
msgid "8 High speed servo PWM outputs."
msgstr "8 路高速舵机 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:18
#: 81273fddd2ff49e4a9c317b6366ff649
msgid "Futaba SBUS or PPM-SUM serial servo output."
msgstr "Futaba SBUS 或 PPM-SUM 串行舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:19
#: d1ab8def321543568df2526b662cff28
msgid "Futaba SBUS, PPM-SUM or Spektrum serial inputs from your receiver."
msgstr "接收机 Futaba SBUS、PPM-SUM 或 Spektrum 串行输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:20
#: 2b10263f3ef74e5d8664ed461c7f622f
msgid ""
"Two user assignable relays, two 1/2 amp 5 volt outputs and an analog input "
"port."
msgstr "两路用户可分配继电器、两路 1/2 安 5V 输出及一路模拟输入端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:22
#: 79a7249d786f411993c2103ba9c6af36
msgid "All power inputs are reverse polarity protected."
msgstr "所有电源输入均有极性反接保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:23
#: 29d56292c3784a9a847a28eef79c0f4c
msgid "All power outputs are current limited."
msgstr "所有电源输出均有限流保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:24
#: 72e1ff0dd755480da5a79286a884e24f
msgid "All logic inputs and outputs are ESD protected."
msgstr "所有逻辑输入和输出均有 ESD 保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:25
#: 9653b0c16875446498438a2221491541
msgid ""
"All PX4IO boards use positive retention DF13 connectors and a variety of "
"connectors."
msgstr "所有 PX4IO 板均使用具有正向锁紧功能的 DF13 连接器及多种接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:27
#: a2044478f07d409182dce94330366789
msgid ""
"Wires with pre-crimped sockets and pre-made cables are available "
"inexpensively for the PX4-IO from 3DRobotics."
msgstr "PX4-IO 所需的预压接插针导线和预制线缆可从 3DRobotics 低价购得。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:31
#: a296a43da3ef4adc93903ab1e34aad73
msgid "The Bottom of the PX4IO Board"
msgstr "PX4IO 板底面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:36
#: b37dd1f43b3c4ba9b2f153f3993d1e3a
msgid "Note the Red Circled item above is ferrite L1."
msgstr "注意上图中红圈标注的是铁氧体 L1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:37
#: 42b38d00f0474f35ae550c9e37990c1c
msgid ""
"For high power servos you can remove L1 to allow you to supply power from an"
" external power supply to a servo connector center pin."
msgstr "对于大功率舵机，可以移除 L1，以便通过外部电源为舵机连接器中间引脚供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:41
#: 9ff7ba170b3d4aba901d3c5dca5c0af0
msgid "The Top of the PX4IO Board"
msgstr "PX4IO 板顶面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:47
#: 385ae7d51f2d44bda859c01be4c34020
msgid "A Brief Description of the PX4IO Board"
msgstr "PX4IO 板简介"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:53
#: 0d0d3b30b97d4a988cd976f84f7419ca
msgid "The PX4IO Board Connector pin assignments"
msgstr "PX4IO 板连接器引脚分配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4io-overview.rst:59
#: b6f80d5f77cd4a22a23ca34c596fd521
msgid "The PX4IO Board Stacks On Top of the PX4-FMU board"
msgstr "PX4IO 板叠加安装在 PX4-FMU 板上方"
